0 25 585 [
[([clone]'s inlets/outlets correspond to those of the contained patch and may be control and/or signal)]
[(inlets/outlets. This example has one control inlet. It also has a signal and another control outlet. You)]
[(can click on the [clone] object to see the first of the cloned instances. At least one control inlet is)]
[(present even if the abstraction has none, so [clone] can receive the 'vis' and 'resize' messages. The)]
[(way control inlets/outlets forward messages is shown below.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
